WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.418
Build a balanced plate

2
00:00:02.418 --> 00:00:32.645
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Build a balanced plate. Alag-alag food groups body ko energy, growth aur sehat ke liye alag nutrients dete hain. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:32.645 --> 00:01:03.476
Dal, chawal, sabzi aur dahi ek meal mein alag tarah ke nutrients laate hain. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:03.476 --> 00:01:38.539
Ghar ke kisi meal ki plate draw karke usme grains, pulses, vegetables aur fruit label karo. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
00:01:38.539 --> 00:02:54.106
Ab practice karo: Protein ka ek common source kaunsa hai? Thoda rukkar socho. Sahi jawab hai Dal. Baaki options kyun fit nahi hote, yeh bhi apne shabdon mein batao. Alag-alag food groups body ko energy, growth aur sehat ke liye alag nutrients dete hain. Dal, chawal, sabzi aur dahi ek meal mein alag tarah ke nutrients laate hain. Is idea ko yaad rakhne ke liye apni notebook mein ek chhota labelled drawing banao. Jab tum apne shabdon mein samjha paate ho, tab tumne sirf answer nahi yaad kiya, balki uska reason bhi samjha. Aaj ka chhota recap: Alag-alag food groups body ko energy, growth aur sehat ke liye alag nutrients dete hain. Agli baar aas-paas ki duniya mein isi idea ka ek aur example dhoondhna.

